==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[Lesley]]

===Etymology===
From a place name in Aberdeenshire, originally ''Lesslyn'', {{Gael.}} ''[[leas]] [[celyn]]'' "garden of hollies".

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{surname|[[Scottish]]|from=Scottish Gaelic}}
# {{given name|male|from=surnames}} derived from the surname. Popular in the U.K. during the first half of the 20th century.
# {{given name|female|from=surnames}}, of mostly American usage.

====Usage notes====
The female given name is usually spelled [[Lesley]] in the U.K.

